---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Eone Labs (이원 랩스) | AI Software Studio">
  <div class="relative overflow-hidden min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-between">
    <!-- Background glow decorative effects -->
    <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[700px] h-[350px] bg-gradient-to-b from-purple-600/20 via-indigo-600/10 to-transparent blur-3xl pointer-events-none -z-10"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 right-10 w-[400px] h-[300px] bg-gradient-to-t from-violet-700/10 to-transparent blur-3xl pointer-events-none -z-10"></div>

    <!-- Navigation -->
    <header class="border-b border-white/5 backdrop-blur-md sticky top-0 z-50">
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 h-16 flex items-center justify-between">
        <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-2.5 font-bold tracking-tight text-lg group">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500 to-indigo-600 flex items-center justify-center text-white shadow-md shadow-purple-500/20 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-200">
            e
          </span>
          <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-white via-slate-200 to-slate-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent">Eone Labs</span>
          <span class="text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-white/10 text-slate-400 font-normal">이원 랩스</span>
        </a>

        <nav class="flex items-center gap-6 text-sm">
          <a href="https://blog.eone.one" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5">
            Engineering Blog
            <span class="text-xs text-purple-400">↗</span>
          </a>
          <a href="mailto:contact@eone.one" class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/15 text-white transition-all text-xs font-medium border border-white/10">
            Contact
          </a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <main class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-center">
      <!-- Status Pill -->
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-purple-500/10 border border-purple-500/30 text-purple-300 text-xs font-medium w-fit mb-6">
        <span class="relative flex h-2 w-2">
          <span class="animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-purple-400 opacity-75"></span>
          <span class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-purple-500"></span>
        </span>
        Hello World · Website Preview Ready
      </div>

      <!-- Hero Heading -->
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white mb-6 leading-[1.15]">
        Building Intelligent Tools for <br />
        <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-400 via-violet-300 to-indigo-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent">
          Everyday Impact.
        </span>
      </h1>

      <p class="text-lg text-slate-400 max-w-2xl mb-12 leading-relaxed">
        이원 랩스(Eone Labs)는 인공지능과 세련된 사용자 경험을 결합하여 교육, 생산성, 라이프스타일 소프트웨어를 만듭니다. 
        일상의 마찰을 줄이고 직관적인 소프트웨어를 탐구합니다.
      </p>

      <!-- Products Grid -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-16">
        <!-- SamLog Card -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/10 hover:border-purple-500/40 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-purple-500/5 group">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-purple-500/20 text-purple-300 border border-purple-500/30">
              AI EdTech SaaS
            </span>
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">In Development</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-purple-300 transition-colors">
            SamLog <span class="text-sm font-normal text-slate-400">(쌤로그)</span>
          </h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
            학원 강사 및 튜터를 위한 초경량 학생 관리 및 평가 보조 SaaS. 출결·과제 쾌속 기록과 Claude AI 기반 맞춤형 학부모 상담 리포트 자동 생성.
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs text-slate-400">
            <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-white/5 border border-white/5">Next.js 16</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-white/5 border border-white/5">Supabase</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-purple-950/50 text-purple-300 border border-purple-800/40">Claude AI</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- DoriDays Card -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/10 hover:border-indigo-500/40 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-indigo-500/5 group">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-indigo-500/20 text-indigo-300 border border-indigo-500/30">
              Apple Ecosystem App
            </span>
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">In Development</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-indigo-300 transition-colors">
            DoriDays <span class="text-sm font-normal text-slate-400">(도리데이즈)</span>
          </h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
            한국천문연구원(KASI) 정밀 음력 엔진 기반 프리미엄 기념일 카운터. Dynamic Island(ActivityKit)와 잠금화면 위젯 완벽 지원.
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs text-slate-400">
            <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-white/5 border border-white/5">SwiftUI</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-white/5 border border-white/5">SwiftData</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-white/5 border border-white/5">WidgetKit</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Setup Checklist / Next Steps -->
      <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-purple-950/20 border border-purple-500/20 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-4">
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-purple-200">배포 준비 가이드</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-0.5">
            로컬에서 <code class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-black/40 text-purple-300 font-mono">pnpm dev</code>로 확인하고, Netlify에 연결하여 배포 테스트를 진행할 수 있습니다.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="text-xs text-emerald-400 font-mono">Astro 7 + Tailwind v4</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer class="border-t border-white/5 py-8 text-center text-xs text-slate-400">
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
        <div>
          © 2026 Eone Labs (이원 랩스). All rights reserved.
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-6">
          <a href="https://blog.eone.one" class="hover:text-slate-300 transition-colors">Blog</a>
          <a href="mailto:contact@eone.one" class="hover:text-slate-300 transition-colors">contact@eone.one</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </div>
</Layout>
